ur gear wisely! With a wide array of both melee and ranged weapons, as well as traps and gadgets, the chance to bring your team to victory is never out of reach\u2026or certain fate.  <br><br><strong>Harvest smart or risk it all: </strong>Only those who make it on the extraction ship will leave with their Nectar, so optimize your tactics, rally your crew and use ANY means necessary to get your nectar onboard! <br><br><strong>Death is NOT the end:</strong> Our respawn system keeps you and your friends together in the action for the entire raid! Revive fallen teammates and plot your revenge to steal that Nectar back!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/b80d511524f1b0c1429920ded88bd60f.poster.avif?t=1714106618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/b80d511524f1b0c1429920ded88bd60f.webm?t=1714106618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/b80d511524f1b0c1429920ded88bd60f.mp4?t=1714106618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>What kind of Raider will you be? </strong>For every day that you survive, gain perks to strengthen your resolve for the next round! Mix and match builds to get the perfect perk combination but beware! Getting stranded on Drosera means losing your perks until your next successful run.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/2a3f60cac937d19f2b23943818e2e65a.poster.avif?t=1714106618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/2a3f60cac937d19f2b23943818e2e65a.webm?t=1714106618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873120/extras/2a3f60cac937d19f2b23943818e2e65a.mp4?t=1714106618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Discover all the planet has to offer: </strong>Drosera is a world full of mystery and much of it has yet to be revealed! Keep your eye open for continuous updates (such as new biomes, characters and gameplay additions,) being added to the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES: </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a dangerous planet rich with sweet, sweet Nectar in 15-minute sessions!<br></li><li>Race through DROSERA with top-of-the-line hoverboards and hoverbikes.<br></li><li>Take part in competitive questing alongside your team and your enemies!<br></li><li>Experience simultaneous PvP and PvE! Go head-to-head against the other crews and take on Droserian wildlife for bigger rewards!<br></li><li>Trade in your nectar for fancy hoverboard and weapon skins, express yourself with extra emotes and more!<br></li><li>Build your perks after every successful extraction to dominate the Raider ranks!<br></li><li>Experience a new adventure in every game with procedurally generated quest chains!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Grab your ragtag crew &amp; take up the Nectar Raiding trade on a dangerous planet that\u2019s become all the rage! In this PvPvE extraction game for 1-10 players, compete against enemy crews to harvest as much Nectar as possible before night falls. But watch out, you're not the only one roaming this planet!",
